WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.425
Regular expressions are useful when simple literal
functions are not enough REGEXP_REPLACE

00:00:07.452 --> 00:00:12.986
can remove or standardize patterns The tilde
operator checks whether

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:18.907
a string matches a pattern Regex is powerful so keep
the rule as simple

00:00:18.921 --> 00:00:24.525
and explainable as possible A complicated expression
that nobody can

00:00:24.552 --> 00:00:26.907
review is a data-quality risk of its own
